より連結決算に移行いたします。（注１）2026年12月期第４四半期から連結財務諸表を作成するため、対前期増減率については記載しておりません。（注２）「１株当たり当期純利益」の算定上の基礎となる期中平均株式数については、2026年９月30日現在の期中平均株式数（四半期累計）を使用しております。連結業績予想の概要株式会社 Work Prime Contract(以下、WPC社) を2026年10月１日に連結子会社化したことに伴い、2026年10月から12月の業績を当社の連結業績予想に織り込んでおります。WPC社の連結子会社化に伴う取得関連費用やのれん償却額などを連結費用として29百万円を見込んでおります。なお、取得関連費用は当期のみに計上される費用でございます。", null, "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 9550000000, "9,550", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 1040000000, "1,040", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 1060000000, "1,060", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 730000000, "730", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 170.6, "170.60", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 9444000000, "9,444", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 1000000000, "1,000", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 1005000000, "1,005", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncome", "NetIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 700000000, "700", "JPY", "CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 162.61, "162.61", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 945